docs {
  # Finance → Payments

  Payment list by mode (`/finance/payments`; All / Cash / UPI / Bank Transfer /
  Debit Card / Credit Card / Wallet / Privilege Card / Loyalty Points).
  **No dedicated finance endpoint yet** — order payments are written via the order
  flow (see **46 Order Payments**). Placeholder for a finance payments list endpoint.
}
